    "description": {
      "value": "<p>If you begin a theory as part of a successful use of recall information, you gain one notion on the theory, plus another for every 10 by which you exceed the DC (maximum equal to your operative ability modifier).</p>\n<p>You can outwit the creature as a cost to instead gain one notion for every 5 by which you exceed the DC (rather than every 10).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/study#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
